3. Risks of Misinformation and MIsleading Claims

Content in Database
The stystem currently contains:
- 20 exhibits
- 40 quizzes

Each exhibit includes:
- Failure description, contributing factors, lessons learned
- Supporting artefacts
- Timeline information

Risks
Ai failure case studies risk:
- Oversimplification of complex technical issues
- Factural errors in technincal explanations
- Reputable dama if real organisations are unfairly portrayed
- Misunderstanding AI capabilities and limitations

Mitigation

Content creation:
- Exhibits created/edited only by curators
- Django admin logs all changes
- Each exhibit has a timestamp it was created for tracking

Naming policy:
- Public incidents with wide reporting: name organisation correctly
- Sensitivie incidents: anonymise

Red lines:
- Never name indivdual developers, includer personal identifying information, use inflammatory language and never present speculation as fact.

Change tracking:
- All exhibit modifications are logged to identify which exhibits have been modified
